          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Hypericum montanum is a plant species in the genus Hypericum commonly known as pale St. John's-wort or mountain St. John's wort. It is native to Eurasia and Morocco in North Africa."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": "Description\nHypericum montanum are normally from 20 to 80 centimeters (8–32 inches). Its flower has five petals and it flowers from July to August."
          }
        ]
